#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:2
msgid "Request Transport"
msgstr "请求传输"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache MP clients select the request transport from the LMCache server "
"URL. This transport carries control and cache-operation requests; it is "
"separate from ``--supported-transfer-mode``, which controls how KV data "
"moves between the engine worker and the LMCache server."
msgstr "LMCache MP 客户端从 LMCache 服务器 URL 中选择请求传输。该传输承载控制和缓存操作请求；它与 ``--supported-transfer-mode`` 分开，后者控制 KV 数据在引擎工作进程和 LMCache 服务器之间的移动。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:10
msgid "Transport schemes"
msgstr "传输方案"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:16
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:17
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "传输"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:18
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:19
msgid "``host:port`` or ``tcp://host:port``"
msgstr "``host:port`` 或 ``tcp://host:port``"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:20
msgid "ZMQ over TCP"
msgstr "通过 TCP 的 ZMQ"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:21
msgid "Supported. A URL without a scheme defaults to ``tcp://``."
msgstr "支持。没有方案的 URL 默认使用 ``tcp://``。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:22
msgid "``ipc://path`` or ``inproc://name``"
msgstr "``ipc://path`` 或 ``inproc://name``"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:23
msgid "ZMQ IPC or in-process"
msgstr "ZMQ IPC 或进程内"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:24
msgid ""
"Recognized by the client factory; the standard LMCache server currently "
"binds ZMQ over TCP."
msgstr "客户端工厂识别；标准的 LMCache 服务器当前通过 TCP 绑定 ZMQ。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:26
msgid "``grpc://host:port`` or ``grpc+unix:///path``"
msgstr "``grpc://host:port`` 或 ``grpc+unix:///path``"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:27
msgid "gRPC"
msgstr "gRPC"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:28
msgid "Supported."
msgstr "支持。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:31
msgid "gRPC implementation and schema development"
msgstr "gRPC 实现和架构开发"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:33
msgid ""
"The gRPC client and server live under "
"``lmcache/v1/multiprocess/transport/grpc_impl``. They expose the same "
"named ``RequestClient`` operations and annotated engine-module handlers "
"as ZMQ, while protobuf defines the gRPC wire format. Schemas live in the "
"sibling ``protos`` directory, and package builds generate their Python "
"bindings under ``_proto_gen``."
msgstr "gRPC 客户端和服务器位于 ``lmcache/v1/multiprocess/transport/grpc_impl``。它们暴露与 ZMQ 相同命名的 ``RequestClient`` 操作和注释的引擎模块处理程序，同时 protobuf 定义了 gRPC 传输格式。模式位于兄弟目录 ``protos`` 中，包构建会在 ``_proto_gen`` 下生成它们的 Python 绑定。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:40
msgid "After changing a schema, regenerate and validate all bindings with:"
msgstr "更改模式后，使用以下命令重新生成并验证所有绑定："

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:47
msgid ""
"For a single vLLM connector, set the scheme in ``lmcache.mp.host`` and "
"keep the port in ``lmcache.mp.port``. A ZMQ configuration is:"
msgstr "对于单个 vLLM 连接器，请在 ``lmcache.mp.host`` 中设置方案，并将端口保留在 ``lmcache.mp.port`` 中。ZMQ 配置为："

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:57
msgid "To select gRPC, use the same configuration shape with a ``grpc://`` host:"
msgstr "要选择 gRPC，请使用相同的配置格式，并将主机设置为 ``grpc://``："

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:66
msgid "Start the server with the matching request transport:"
msgstr "使用匹配的请求传输启动服务器："

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:73
msgid ""
"For multiple servers, specify the scheme on every entry in "
"``lmcache.mp.server_urls``, for example "
"``tcp://host1:5555,tcp://host2:5555`` or "
"``grpc://host1:5555,grpc://host2:5555``. All clients and servers in a "
"deployment must use matching transports."
msgstr "对于多个服务器，请在 ``lmcache.mp.server_urls`` 中的每个条目上指定方案，例如 ``tcp://host1:5555,tcp://host2:5555`` 或 ``grpc://host1:5555,grpc://host2:5555``。所有客户端和服务器在部署中必须使用匹配的传输。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:81
msgid "IPC descriptor compatibility"
msgstr "IPC 描述符兼容性"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:83
msgid ""
"Device IPC wrappers use versioned, data-only MessagePack descriptors in "
"both transports. Legacy pickle descriptors are rejected; upgrade workers "
"and servers together. MUSA handles must use MessagePack scalars, lists "
"and string-keyed maps; opaque SDK objects require an explicit codec and "
"are rejected."
msgstr "设备 IPC 包装器在两种传输中使用版本化的、仅包含数据的 MessagePack 描述符。遗留的 pickle 描述符被拒绝；请同时升级工作进程和服务器。MUSA 句柄必须使用 MessagePack 标量、列表和字符串键映射；不透明的 SDK 对象需要显式编解码器，并被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:88
msgid ""
"This closes the device-wrapper deserialization path in CVE-2026-105192. "
"The engine-driven tensor-data path uses a separate typed inline codec "
"that shares the descriptor dtype allowlist. Neither change adds RPC "
"authentication; keep MP endpoints restricted to trusted clients."
msgstr "这关闭了 CVE-2026-105192 中的设备包装器反序列化路径。引擎驱动的张量数据路径使用一个单独的类型内联编解码器，该编解码器共享描述符数据类型允许列表。两个更改都没有添加 RPC 身份验证；请将 MP 端点限制为受信任的客户端。"

